<title>USA: Heartland Wireless Q1 share loss widens.</title>
<headline>Heartland Wireless Q1 share loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $1.41		loss$0.54</p>
<p> Net loss	  27,600	     loss8,200</p>
<p> Revs		19,200		   9,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Heartland Wireless Communications Inc.</p>
<p>The company incurred charges during the fourth quarter of 1996 totaling $9.1 million.</p>
<p>In addition, during the first quarter of 1997, Heartland launched two operating systems and acquired two systems in operation.</p>
